[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "text": "Is this Bishop's grave?"
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "text": "Yeah..."
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "text": "Were you friends?"
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "text": "Yes. We never met in person."
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "But we knew each other well."
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "We exchanged many letters."
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "Even though our countries and "
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "languages were different,"
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "we truly understood "
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "text": "each other..."
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "text": " "
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "text": "I am very much indebted to him."
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": "He gave me courage."
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": "Oh, I'm just rambling."
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "Don't mind me."
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "By any chance..."
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "Do you know his best friend, "
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "Travis?"
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": "Of course."
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "Excellent..."
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": "In that case, would you "
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "text": "please give this to him?"
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "text": "It's from Bishop."
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "text": "This...? "
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "text": "It is a lot of things, "
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "text": "I suppose."
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "text": "Knowing it is in your hands, "
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "text": "I can have peace of mind."
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "text": "Now, let me light some incense"
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "text": "before I go."
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "text": "Thanks... I promise to deliver "
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "text": "it to my Master."
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "text": "Please do."
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "text": "Yeah?"
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "text": "Shinobu, "
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "text": "the next match is ready."
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "text": "On my way."
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "text": "This better be good."
  }
]